{"4665590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Apotheosis Engine", "steam_appid": 4665590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665590/extras/cb5110ca69b7c2f6f374f60c8a93f43f.poster.avif?t=1788351853\" width=630 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665590/extras/cb5110ca69b7c2f6f374f60c8a93f43f.webm?t=1788351853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665590/extras/cb5110ca69b7c2f6f374f60c8a93f43f.mp4?t=1788351853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After countless millennia drifting in space, you awaken. You will act as an agent in an operating system of a space probe from a long lost, far away civilization. Discover and invent new functionality, add to yourself and evolve to become a cosmic god.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather, Harvest, Refine, Grow, Explore,  Expand, Exploit, Exterminate,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain sentience over time and evolve your gameplay by discovering new apps, new ways of playing, and new secrets hidden deep within the machine code.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665590/extras/f411913404bf8153743515cfe8bb5ec1.poster.avif?t=1788351853\" width=534 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665590/extras/f411913404bf8153743515cfe8bb5ec1.webm?t=1788351853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665590/extras/f411913404bf8153743515cfe8bb5ec1.mp4?t=1788351853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665590/extras/95f832334a91ac1cddd98b0aae153773.avif?t=1788351853\" width=1414 height=276 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solid incremental gameplay; a mix of long term goals and short term gains</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Addictive</strong> idle mechanics with some new twists on the idle genre</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving</strong> gameplay over various stages; each with completely different ways to play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique way to play; navigate an alien operating system and discover its secrets; engage in different 'apps' at once</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam achievements and leaderboards</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665590/extras/cb5110ca69b7c2f6f374f60c8a93f43f.poster.avif?t=1788351853\" width=630 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665590/extras/cb5110ca69b7c2f6f374f60c8a93f43f.webm?t=1788351853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665590/extras/cb5110ca69b7c2f6f374f60c8a93f43f.mp4?t=1788351853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After countless millennia drifting in space, you awaken. You will act as an agent in an operating system of a space probe from a long lost, far away civilization. Discover and invent new functionality, add to yourself and evolve to become a cosmic god.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather, Harvest, Refine, Grow, Explore,  Expand, Exploit, Exterminate,</p><p class=